 them and  say I can't work with anybody i'm going  to be a lone wolf for the rest of my  life right and that doesn't help you  accomplish the mission that you're on  doesn't help you accomplish the dream  business that you want to build and how  the impact  you want to have and so when you make a  mistake it's how do you know what the  mistake is and then what the corrective  action should be sometimes it's really  obvious other times it might need a  little bit more thinking because there's  so many entrepreneurs who then do the  wrong thing after making a mistake the  second thing is then having an awareness  two of the mistakes that you make  subconsciously and I think because of  limiting beliefs that that you've grown  up with and that you tell yourself that  hold you back in your business you're  making tons of mistakes every day and  you don't even realize it right if it's  something obvious and it's something  that you can fix but there's a lot of  mistakes you're making without even  knowing it because you have a broken  mind set I remember one that I've talked  about in channel when I was younger was  I always felt like I was too young to be  able to sell software the people who  were three times my age and I phd's and  I'm not a scientist I'm trying to sell  scientific software the mistake wasn't  in not calling it was not believing in  myself enough right in thinking that I  was too young and and I did just I never  caught it until much later because it  was just so subconscious that I kept  making these mistakes over and over and  over and over again I never caught it so  I never improved and never got better  and it took a while before I did  eventually pick up on it and so it's  having the awareness that you're making  the mistake as well and that can be  where one having people around you to  help point out mistakes can help for me  when I find super helpful is modeling  success and looking up to big  entrepreneurs and musicians and actors  and innovators in politicians who've  done their part to change the world and  seeing how they act and looking at that  to think of well how can I learn from  them and what am i doing that is not  quite at that level yet and every time I  do that I find some kind of limited  belief that i have that as soon as you  get awareness of it that's the first  step to solving the problem and so yes  you never want to try to make the same  mistake twice but just make sure you  take the right action after making that  mistake  and then try to tap into your  subconscious to figure out the mindsets  and limiting beliefs that are holding  you in place so that you can make  corrective action and build the business  of your dreams so the question today  today is I want to know what mistakes  you are making on an ongoing basis leave  it in the comments below I'm going to  join the discussion thank you so much  for watching have an amazing day  continue to believe and I'll see you  again tomorrow morning for another shot  of espresso
 

